                </p>
                <div class="mt-4 pt-4 bg-surface-container p-2 rounded text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">water_drop</span>
                    <span class="">Hydration &amp; Freshness</span>
